  "about": "Living people a cask style fragment never names (style.txt, PEOPLE): current and recent distillers, blenders, owners and founders of the houses a style page reaches for, and writers and bartenders an author might quote. schema.mjs reads this list and tools/backbar/people.json together, refuses any string that carries one of these names as a whole phrase, and refuses any run of capitalised words that proper-nouns.json, houses.json and the app's own names do not allow, so this list is the explicit backstop, not the whole rule. Historic founders and figures (Masataka Taketsuru, Shinjiro Torii, Aeneas Coffey, Pappy Van Winkle, Jack Daniel, George Dickel, Elijah Craig, John Jameson) are allowed and never listed here. Add a name the moment a source shows one; never remove one.",
